,TELEPHONY_DIRECTORY_UNAVAILABLE:`The user directory is unavailable right now; try again in a moment.`,TELEPHONY_MAC_KEY_UNAVAILABLE:`The telephony service can't issue webhook credentials right now (signing key unavailable). Contact your administrator.`,TELEPHONY_INTEGRATION_NOT_CONFIGURED:`This telephony integration isn't fully configured yet.`,TELEPHONY_NOT_FOUND:`That telephony integration, mapping or call no longer exists.`,FIELD_IN_USE:`This field is the phone field of a telephony integration. Confirm the cascade in the layout builder to detach it and delete the field.`,TELEPHONY_DETACH_UNAVAILABLE:`The telephony service couldn't confirm its integrations were detached, so the field was not deleted. Try again in a moment.`,ZOBOT_CONSENT_STATUS_INVALID:`The consent card must record either granted or denied — it can't record "never asked".`,STORAGE_SCOPE_IMMUTABLE:`This module's data storage level can't be changed after it is created.`,PHONE_HEALTH_UNAVAILABLE:`The number's health couldn't be refreshed — Meta couldn't be reached or refused the read. Try again shortly.`,WA_CODE_REQUEST_REJECTED:`Meta didn't accept the verification-code request. Check the delivery method and try again — repeated requests are rate-limited.`,WA_CODE_INVALID:`Meta refused this verification code — it may be wrong or expired. Request a new one.`,WA_VERIFY_UNAVAILABLE:`The verification service couldn't be reached. Try again shortly.`,BUSINESS_PROFILE_INVALID:`Meta refused one of the business-profile fields. Check the highlighted field and try again.`,BUSINESS_PROFILE_UNAVAILABLE:`The business profile couldn't be reached at Meta. Try again shortly.`,TEMPLATE_RESTART_SEND_FAILED:`The conversation was reopened to send the template, the send failed, and it has been closed again. Nothing was delivered.`,TIMEOUT_HANDLER_TYPE_INVALID:`That handler isn't one this workspace recognises. Pick one from the list.`,TIMEOUT_ACTION_INVALID:`Pick what happens when the window elapses — end the chat, or mark it missed.`,TIMEOUT_WARN_MODE_INVALID:`Pick how the visitor is warned — a message in the chat, a widget alarm, or both.`,TIMEOUT_CHANNEL_KEY_INVALID:`That channel isn't one this workspace recognises. Pick one from the list.`,TIMEOUT_SECONDS_OUT_OF_RANGE:`A window must be between 1 second and 30 days.`,TIMEOUT_WARN_NOT_BEFORE_TIMEOUT:`The warning has to come before the chat ends, or it could never be delivered.`,TIMEOUT_WARN_REQUIRES_TIMEOUT:`A warning needs a timeout. With the timeout off the chat never ends, so the warning would never be sent.`,TIMEOUT_OVERRIDE_MUST_NARROW:`An override has to narrow on a channel, a handler or a brand — otherwise it just repeats the global default.`,TIMEOUT_SCOPE_ALREADY_EXISTS:`Another rule already covers this exact combination. Edit that one, or narrow this rule further.`,TIMEOUT_DEFAULT_NOT_DELETABLE:`The global default can't be deleted — it's the fallback every chat needs. Set its window to never instead.`,TIMEOUT_DEFAULT_NOT_SCOPABLE:`The global default applies to every conversation and can't be narrowed. Create an override instead.`,TIMEOUT_BRAND_NOT_FOUND:`That brand no longer exists. Pick another, or leave the brand as Any.`,TIMEOUT_TITLE_REQUIRED:`Give this rule a name.`,TIMEOUT_MESSAGE_TOO_LONG:`That message is too long. Shorten it to 1000 characters or fewer.`,TIMEOUT_MISSED_RULE_SHAPE_INVALID:`A missed-chat rule can't warn anyone or mark a chat missed again — nobody is attending it. Turn the warning off and choose to end the chat.`,TIMEOUT_RULE_NOT_FOUND:`That timeout rule no longer exists — someone may have deleted it. Reload the page.`,TEMPLATE_EDIT_LIMIT_REACHED:`Meta allows a template to be edited once a day and ten times a month, and this one has reached that limit. Try again later, or duplicate it to publish a new version now.`,TEMPLATE_EDIT_REJECTED:`Meta didn't accept the change to this template. Check the message against their content rules and try again.`,TEMPLATE_MANAGED_EXTERNALLY:`Templates for this number are managed by your account manager. Use Sync to load the latest approved templates.`,WHATSAPP_PROVIDER_UNSUPPORTED:`This WhatsApp number is managed by your account manager, so this action isn't available for it.`,TEMPLATE_PARAMETERS_UNSUPPORTED:`This template has a variable in its header or in a button link, which this WhatsApp number can't fill. Choose a template whose variables are all in the body.`,MEDIA_FORMAT_UNSUPPORTED:`This channel doesn't accept that file format. Save it in one of the formats the composer lists and attach it again.`,MEDIA_CONTENT_MISMATCH:`This file isn't what its name says — its contents are a different type. Rename it with the correct extension, or send the file you meant.`,PERMISSION_SERVICE_UNAVAILABLE:`Permissions can't be checked right now. Nothing has changed — try again in a moment.`,permission_service_degraded:`Permissions can't be checked right now. Nothing has changed — try again in a moment.`,SERVICE_UNAVAILABLE:`The service is temporarily unavailable. Try again in a moment.`,HTTP_503:`The service is temporarily unavailable. Try again in a moment.`,GATEWAY_TIMEOUT:`The service took too long to respond. Try again in a moment.`,HTTP_504:`The service took too long to respond. Try again in a moment.`,NOT_A_SUBORDINATE:`You can only view the work queue of people in your team.`,BROADCAST_NAME_CONTAINS_PHONE_NUMBER:`Names are shown to everyone who can see broadcasts, including people who may not see customers' phone numbers. Remove the phone number from the name.`,CAMPAIGN_NAME_CONTAINS_PHONE_NUMBER:`Names are shown to everyone who can see campaigns, including people who may not see customers' phone numbers. Remove the phone number from the name.`,PRICE_NOT_AVAILABLE:`This item has no price in your billing currency yet. Contact support.`,PAYMENT_GATEWAY_UNAVAILABLE:`Online payment is unavailable right now. Try again later or contact support.`,OFFER_NOT_ELIGIBLE:`This offer code can't be used on this purchase.`,OFFER_EXHAUSTED:`This offer code has been fully redeemed.`,OFFER_NOT_FOUND:`This offer code doesn't exist or has expired.`,PURCHASE_NOT_FOUND:`This purchase could not be found.`,PURCHASE_NOT_CANCELLABLE:`This purchase can no longer be cancelled — its payment has already gone through or ended. Refresh the page.`,INVOICE_NOT_FOUND:`This invoice could not be found.`,INVOICE_STATE_INVALID:`This invoice can't be paid in its current state. Refresh the page.`,PAYMENT_NOT_FOUND:`This payment could not be found.`,CHECKOUT_IN_PROGRESS:`A payment page for this is already being prepared. Try again in a moment.`,BILLING_DOWNSTREAM_UNAVAILABLE:`Billing is temporarily unavailable. Nothing was charged — try again in a moment.`,SKU_INVALID:`This credit pack is no longer offered. Refresh the page.`,IDEMPOTENCY_CONFLICT:`This request was already sent with different details. Refresh the page and try again.`,IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_REQUIRED:`The request was missing its safety key. Refresh the page and try again.`,IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_TOO_LONG:`The request's safety key is too long. Refresh the page and try again.`,IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_IN_USE:`This request is still being processed. Wait a moment, then try again.`,SMS_INSUFFICIENT_CREDITS:`Not enough SMS & WhatsApp credits. Nothing was sent and nothing was charged — buy credits and try again.`,SMS_NO_ROUTE:`SMS can't be sent to this destination yet.`,SMS_ROUTE_UNPRICED:`SMS to this destination isn't priced yet, so nothing was sent.`,SMS_RATES_UNAVAILABLE:`SMS prices are temporarily unavailable. Nothing was sent — try again in a moment.`,SMS_PROVIDER_UNAVAILABLE:`The SMS provider is temporarily unavailable. Try again in a moment.`,SMS_INVALID_PHONE:`That isn't a valid phone number.`,SMS_SENDER_NOT_APPROVED:`This sender name isn't approved for sending yet.`,SMS_SUPPRESSED:`This number opted out of marketing messages.`,SMS_MONTHLY_CAP_REACHED:`The monthly SMS limit for this account has been reached.`,SMS_DAILY_CAP_REACHED:`This recipient already received today's marketing message.`,